  "solution": "The pattern followed in the given series is:\n\n**(First term + Second term) ÷ 2 = Third term**\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given set:\n\n(96,112,104)\n\n__**(96 + 112)**__ ÷ 2 = 104\n\n__**208 **÷ **2**__ = 104\n\n104 = 104\n\nNow we apply the pattern in the given options:\n\nOption 1) (84, 118, 101)\n\n__**(84 + 118)**__ ÷ 2 = 101\n\n__**202 **____**÷ 2**__ = 101\n\n101 = 101\n\nOption 2) (56, 114, 85)\n\n(56 + 114) ÷ 2 = 85\n\n__**170 **____**÷ 2**__ = 85\n\n85 = 85\n\nOption 3) (48, 116, 82)\n\n__**(48 + 116)**__ ÷ 2 = 82\n\n**__164 __****__÷ 2__** = 82\n\n82 = 82\n\n**Option 4) (92, 114, 106)**\n\n**__(92 + 114)__ ÷ 2 = 106**\n\n**__206 ÷ 2__ = 106**\n\n**103 ≠ 106**\n\n**The set in option 4 does not follow the same rule.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **option 4).**",
